                            <comment id="15686376" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 22 Nov 2016 10:52:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Add &lt;tt&gt;isGeometryClass&lt;/tt&gt; to &lt;tt&gt;GridQueryProcessor.initializeCache&lt;/tt&gt; fixes the problem with incorrect type passed to H2 engine:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (binaryEnabled &amp;amp;&amp;amp; !keyOrValMustDeserialize) {
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;// Safe to check &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (SQL_TYPES.contains(valCls) || isGeometryClass(valCls))
        desc.valueClass(valCls);
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt;
        desc.valueClass(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt;.class);

    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (SQL_TYPES.contains(keyCls) || isGeometryClass(keyCls))
        desc.keyClass(keyCls);
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt;
        desc.keyClass(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt;.class);
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15687073" author="dmagda" created="Tue, 22 Nov 2016 15:45:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, please the changes in the master and after this make sure that the example from this ticket executes successfully&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4238&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4238&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

